1. Description

    Developed a dedicated AI Healthcare Assistant landing section for the Pharma Store website to introduce customers to the AI-powered healthcare assistance functionality.

    The landing experience was designed as a prominent homepage feature that explains the purpose of the AI Assistant, highlights its capabilities, and provides clear navigation toward the assistant interface.

    The implementation focuses on creating a modern healthcare-focused presentation while keeping the interface simple, trustworthy, and easy for customers to understand.

2. Business Requirement

    The Pharma Store required a dedicated promotional experience for its AI Healthcare Assistant.

    The landing section needed to:

     Introduce the AI Healthcare Assistant.
     Explain its purpose clearly.
     Highlight healthcare-related assistance.
     Provide examples of supported queries.
     Build customer awareness.
     Provide a clear entry point to the AI Assistant.
     Integrate naturally with the pharmacy website.
     Maintain the existing Pharma Store visual identity.


3. AI Healthcare Assistant Landing Section

     Created a dedicated homepage section containing:

     AI Assistant heading.
