4. Hero Content

    Designed the main AI Assistant promotional content around a clear value proposition.

    Heading
    Your Personal AI Healthcare Assistant
    Supporting Content

    Communicates that customers can interact with the assistant to get general information and guidance related to medicines and healthcare products.

    The content was kept concise so users can understand the feature without reading a large amount of text.

5. AI Assistant Visual

    Integrated a dedicated AI/healthcare visual to make the section more engaging.

    The visual concept includes:

    AI assistant/robot representation.
    Medicine products.
    Healthcare elements.
    Chat interface cues.
    Medical-themed visual elements.

    The image was designed to complement the homepage background rather than appear as a separate rectangular block.

6. Feature Highlights

    Added feature highlights to communicate the primary capabilities of the AI Assistant.

    Examples include:

    🤖 AI-Powered Assistance


    💊 Medicine Information


    🩺 Healthcare Guidance


    💬 Conversational Interaction

     These features allow users to understand the purpose of the assistant at a glance.

7. Call-to-Action

    Added a prominent CTA for entering the AI Assistant.

    Primary action:

    [ Ask AI Assistant → ]

    The CTA is positioned prominently within the landing section so users can easily start interacting with the assistant.

8. AI Assistant Navigation

    The landing section connects the promotional content to the AI Assistant interface.

     Workflow:

     Homepage
        ↓
     AI Healthcare Assistant Section
        ↓
     Read Feature Information
        ↓
     Click "Ask AI Assistant"
        ↓
     AI Assistant Interface

     This provides a direct path from awareness to interaction.

9. Healthcare-Focused Design

    The landing section follows the overall Pharma Store visual language.

    Implemented:

    Healthcare color palette.
    Soft background tones.
    Modern typography.
    Rounded components.
    Clean spacing.
    Subtle shadows.
    Professional medical imagery.
    Consistent CTA styling.

    The objective was to make the AI feature feel like an integrated part of the pharmacy platform rather than a separate application.

